---
// Markup as published by the Webflow build (ported 2026-11-18).
---

<section id="hero" data-motion="theme" data-theme="dark" class="section-hero">
  <div data-motion="hero-ball-sticky" class="hero-sticky">
    <div class="hero-plate"></div>
    <div data-motion="hero-ball-wrap" class="hero-axis">
      <div data-side="left" data-motion="hero-divider" class="ball-line is-left"></div>
      <div data-motion="hero-ball-border" class="ball-ring"></div>
      <div data-motion="hero-ball" class="ball is-hero"></div>
      <div data-side="right" data-motion="hero-divider" class="ball-line is-right"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-lead">
    <div data-motion="hero-text" class="hero-text">
      <p class="body-lg">UI/UX animation emphasizes the details to which users should pay attention, helping them navigate the site.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-statement">
    <h1 data-motion="hero-title" class="heading-xl">Good animation also makes the whole user experience more memorable and exciting.</h1>
  </div>
</section>
